libProgressBar
------------------------------------------
libProgressBar is a C++ library to manage... Progress bars!!!

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libProgressBar-devel-2.2.3-1bl1
  libProgressBar1-2.2.3-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://gite.lirmm.fr/doccy/libProgressBar/

Canonical download:
  https://gite.lirmm.fr/doccy/libProgressBar/-/archive/v2.2.3/libProgressBar-v2.2.3.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libProgressBar-2.2.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libProgressBar-2.2.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libProgressBar-2.2.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libProgressBar-2.2.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libProgressBar1-2.2.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libProgressBar-devel-2.2.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libProgressBar)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libProgressBar.README
  /usr/share/doc/libProgressBar/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libProgressBar/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libProgressBar/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libProgressBar/README

(libProgressBar1)
  /usr/bin/cygProgressBar-1.dll

(libProgressBar-devel)
  /usr/include/ProgressBar
  /usr/include/libProgressBar-2.2.3/progressBar.h
  /usr/lib/ProgressBar
  /usr/lib/libProgressBar-2.2.3/include/config.h
  /usr/lib/libProgressBar.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libProgressBar-2.2.3.pc
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libProgressBar.pc

